  "source": "Unverified seed (S10, 19 Oct 2026): from docs/RULES.md draft v0.2, ledger decisions D25, D28, D29, D30 and S34, and the owner's board images of 18 and 19 Oct 2026.",
  "notes": "Each capture option of sunMoon.capture is its own group of moves. Reading of diagonal-only: it moves as usual but captures only on diagonal moves. Coast opening is game state (S17). Ways off the Coast (coast.2p.exit, coast.3p.exit) and capture on the Coast are square rules (S22a; coast.3p.exit reads hasLeft, S68). Not expressed yet (engine feature): promotion (sunMoon.canPromote: no promotion targets have been given). givesCheck follows the 2-player setting; in 3-player games the game reads dragon.3p.givesCheck and the duel instead (S56, src/game/three.ts, decision 0016)."
